  "title": "Pasta with Pesto and Scallops",
  "description": "A fragrant saute of onions, garlic, bell pepper and mushrooms is simmered with white wine and lemon juice, with fresh scallops tossed in to soak up the flavors. Serve with fettuccine bathed in pesto, and sprinkle with Parmesan cheese.",
